<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns three secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns three secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed all three auctions whereby it sought to drain</p>
<p>liquidity from the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>750  million pesos   13 days  23.40  23.30   23.37    6    5</p>
<p>750  million pesos    7 days  22.90  22.89   22.90    4    4</p>
<p>307  million pesos    3 days  22.30  22.30   22.30    2    2</p>
<p>NOTE: The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
